# Balcony herb garden

Set up a small herb garden on the balcony this week, before the weekend rain.

## Step 1: Plan

- [ ] Measure the balcony railing and floor space on {D0}
- [ ] Pick herbs: tulsi, mint, coriander, curry leaf on {D0}
- [ ] Order 4 planters and a drip tray by {D1}

## Step 2: Buy

- [ ] Buy potting mix and cocopeat at the nursery on {D2}
- [ ] Buy seedlings for tulsi and curry leaf on {D2}

## Step 3: Plant

- [ ] Fill the planters and plant the seedlings on {D4}
- [ ] Sow coriander seeds on {D4}
- [ ] Set up a watering reminder for every morning from {D5}
